<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 28-FEB.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 28-FEB.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Lisette, with 65 mph winds, is in the Mozambique Channel near 21s/40e, moving south at 4 mph. This motion is expected to continue as the storm slowly strengthens during the next 48 hours, threatning mostly shipping. Top winds may be 85-95 mph in 48 hours with the system located southwest of Madagascar.  </p>
<p>There are no further emergency statements at this time.  </p>
<p>There are no further emergency statements at this time.</p>
